    "Metadata": {
        "Id": "b124fd0f-ee8d-430d-98d9-ed96a4450052",
        "Type": "usercreated",
        "Title": "The engineer //  I",
        "Location": "LOCATION_PARIS",
        "PublicId": "102366621617",
        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/Paris/_scene_paris.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository 5a3a3205-75d6-4cd9-b397-fee70e878601).Image",
        "Description": "It must be stated that you have accumulated vasts amount of knowledge as an engineer. Our anonymous contractor has requested, that we kill our targets, while emulating the behavior of an engineer. Our contractor has made it clear that he has further intentions of employing our services  and that the difficulty of the contracts will progressively increase. As of now our contractor has yet to inform us on the reasoning behind these assassinations. I shall leave you to prepare.\r\r-Happy hunting 47",
